0,0.0,0.0,0.001,0.001,0.001],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"“That’s hardly due North,” says Thacker with a sigh, “But at least you’re trying not to use GPS. No one wants to go anywhere without it these days.”","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.352,"end":11.008,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":28,"words":28},"large":{"start":0.352,"end":10.96,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":28,"words":28},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"You smile and rather than explain that GPS won’t be needed where you’re going, you hold out the tiny, precious treasure map.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":11.328,"end":18.752,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":22,"words":22},"large":{"start":11.328,"end":18.752,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":22,"words":22},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"\"Is this a treasure map? It’s barely readable. No measurements of longitude. Doesn't even have a compass rose, just a measure of prevailing winds. You'd be mad trying to follow this.\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":19.264,"end":30.304,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":31,"words":31},"large":{"start":19.264,"end":30.26,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":31,"words":31},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"You smile at him, expectantly.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":30.624,"end":32.768,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":5},"large":{"start":30.624,"end":32.768,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":5},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"\"Meet you on the ship,\" he says. \"I'll find my own way there.\" He has one more look at the object. \"Though, certainly not using this bloody useless thing.\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":33.952,"end":43.296,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":29,"words":29},"large":{"start":33.952,"end":43.296,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":29,"words":29},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"As Mr. Thacker walks to your ship, you can’t help but admire the “spyglass”. You should take a photo of it to add to your pirate coat of arms. Lean into the symbolism around clear vision and whatnot.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":44.064,"end":56.6,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":38,"words":38},"large":{"start":44.064,"end":56.5,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":38,"words":38},"differ":false},{"i":6,"text":"⚠️ Don't forget, download each photo right after you take it, or risk losing that masterpiece to the digital deep.","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":19},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":19},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68f92c86767dc_crest_v2.png"}